---
const version = import.meta.env.npm_package_version || '1.6.2'
---

<footer
  id="contact"
  class="relative mt-auto bg-linear-to-br from-shamrock-900 via-shamrock-800 to-shamrock-900 text-shamrock-50"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-12 lg:px-8 lg:py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12">
      {/* Company Info */}
      <aside class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-3 font-poppins text-2xl font-bold text-shamrock-200">RYUU Cafe <span class="text-lg">りゅう</span></h2>
          <div class="h-1 w-16 rounded-full bg-shamrock-400"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm font-sarabun text-shamrock-100/90 leading-relaxed">
          {/* Bangkok Branch */}
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <p class="font-bold text-shamrock-200 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-poppins flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>📍 สาขาเสนานิคม (กรุงเทพฯ)</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-medium">เปิดบริการ</span>
            </p>
            <p class="flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-shamrock-100/80">
              <span>
                Block Space 34, 1546 ซอยพหลโยธิน 34<br />
                แขวงเสนานิคม เขตจตุจักร กรุงเทพฯ (08:30 - 17:30 น.)
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>

          {/* Korat Branch */}
          <div class="space-y-1.5 pt-3 border-t border-shamrock-700/60">
            <p class="font-bold text-shamrock-200 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-poppins flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>📍 สาขาโคราช (นครราชสีมา)</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] bg-amber-400/20 text-amber-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-medium">เร็วๆ นี้</span>
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-shamrock-200/70">
              อำเภอเมือง จังหวัดนครราชสีมา (Coming Soon)
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="mt-6 border-t border-shamrock-700 pt-4 text-xs text-shamrock-200/70">
            © 2024–2026 ryuucafe.com. All rights reserved.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-shamrock-400/60">v{version}</p>
        </div>
      </aside>

      {/* Delivery Links */}
      <nav class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-3 font-poppins text-lg font-bold text-shamrock-200">Delivery</h2>
          <div class="h-1 w-12 rounded-full bg-shamrock-400"></div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://www.wongnai.com/delivery/businesses/2731010Vj/order?af_channel=54af16e06fdfb5eca174bfee9939bcde&af_force_deeplink=true&c=share_link&pid=lineman_app"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-shamrock-100 transition-colors hover:text-shamrock-300"
            >
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-shamrock-400 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
              </svg>
              Line Man
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://static.robinhood.in.th/app_link.html?URI=robinhoodth://merchantlanding/id/360887"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-shamrock-100 transition-colors hover:text-shamrock-300"
            >
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-shamrock-400 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
              </svg>
              Robinhood
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://grab.onelink.me/2695613898?pid=inappsharing&c=3-C6DATEE3RAXTCX&is_retargeting=true&af_dp=grab%3A%2F%2Fopen%3FscreenType%3DGRABFOOD%26sourceID%3DA4pcqCZkS4%26merchantIDs%3D3-C6DATEE3RAXTCX&af_force_deeplink=true&af_web_dp=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.grab.com"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-shamrock-100 transition-colors hover:text-shamrock-300"
            >
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-shamrock-400 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
              </svg>
              Grab
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://shopee.co.th/universal-link/now-food/shop/10202568?deep_and_deferred=1&shareChannel=copy_link"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-shamrock-100 transition-colors hover:text-shamrock-300"
            >
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-shamrock-400 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
              </svg>
              Shopee Food
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </nav>

      {/* Social Links */}
      <nav class="space-y-4">
        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-3 font-poppins text-lg font-bold text-shamrock-200">Connect</h2>
          <div class="h-1 w-12 rounded-full bg-shamrock-400"></div>
        </div>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://www.instagram.com/ryuu.bkk?igsh=ZG0yMW9paWUyd3Rz&utm_source=qr"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-shamrock-100 transition-colors hover:text-shamrock-300"
            >
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-shamrock-400 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
              </svg>
              Instagram
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://lin.ee/Vb6WFNu"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-shamrock-100 transition-colors hover:text-shamrock-300"
            >
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-shamrock-400 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
              </svg>
              LINE Official
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
